     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">On Thursday, July 31, 2014 12:44:58 PM UTC-4, Dora Zhou wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">I have a matrix RR:\r\n\r\n</div></blockquote></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br>Firstly, you would want to pass this to Stan as a two-dimensional array of integers, rather than a matrix (which is assumed to be real), as in<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#008\">int</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> RR</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">35</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">];</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><br><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Secondly, looping over i and j to do</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"></p><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><font color=\"#0000ff\" face=\"courier new, monospace\"><span style=\"color:#606\">Sigma</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">j</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> x</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">j</span><span style=\"color:#660\">];</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// remember the semi-colon</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></font></div></code></div><p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">does not make sense because x is declared as a one-dimensional vector. Perhaps you intended x to be declared as a matrix?</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Ben</p></div></div>"
    ]
